{"id":"ocupado","lemma":"ocupado","pos":"adj","rank":797,"glosses":["occupied","busy"],"ipa":"/okuˈpado/","forms":{"feminine":"ocupada","masculinePlural":"ocupados","femininePlural":"ocupadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ocupado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuándo estarás ocupado mañana?","en":"When will you be busy tomorrow?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/612380","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Ahora estamos un poco ocupados.","en":"We're a little busy right now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354893","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a bit"]]},{"text":"Él está ocupado con su trabajo.","en":"He is busy with his work.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44590","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"work, job"}]},{"text":"¿Aún estáis ocupadas?","en":"Are you still busy?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/858717","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"stay","l":"estay"},null]},{"text":"Estoy un poco ocupado aquí.","en":"I'm a little busy here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461215","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"here"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"a bit"]]}]}